<section class="page-hero reveal">
  <p class="eyebrow">Showcase</p>
  <h1>Pragmatic surfaces for real teams</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    Arlen is designed to handle product pages, docs, and operational endpoints under one framework.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="feature-grid">
  <% for (NSDictionary *item in [ctx objectForKey:@"showcaseItems"]) { %>
  <article class="feature-card reveal">
    <h2><%= [item objectForKey:@"title"] %></h2>
    <p><%= [item objectForKey:@"description"] %></p>
    <a class="btn btn-link" href="<%= [item objectForKey:@"link"] %>">Open</a>
  </article>
  <% } %>
</section>

<section class="section-block reveal">
  <h2>What this demonstrates</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Route-to-controller structure that remains readable at scale.</li>
    <li>Compiled templates and shared layout primitives for consistent UX.</li>
    <li>One cohesive runtime for product pages, docs, and application endpoints.</li>
  </ul>
</section>
